=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Waoud} at (J-10) as a level 50+ {p:Blue Mage}.
* Ask for a divination by selecting the "Gaze away." dialogue option. He will inform you that "Your fate lies beyond the gate of nobility".
** He will take 1,000 {p:Gil} from you like other Divinations.
*** If you continue talking to him, he will ask if you want another Divination. If you choose yes, he will continue to give you the same message and take more gil from you.
* Go to the **Imperial Whitegate** door at (L-8) in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, and check it for a cut scene.
** You may receive several other cutscenes from this door, depending on your progress in various areas. Continue to examine the door until you receive the correct cutscene.
*** You can confirm that you have seen the correct cutscene by checking whether this quest is currently flagged as Active for you.
* The quest is now listed in your current quest log. **At this point, you do not need to be on {p:Blue Mage} to continue the quest.**
* Your next goal is to obtain two cutscenes in the {z:Alzadaal Undersea Ruins}. The easiest way to achieve this is to do the following:
** Use the {p:Runic Portal} in Whitegate to go to {p:Nyzul Isle Staging Point}.
** Use the north exit from the staging point, and step on the North-East teleporter on the large map that you are on (toward {p:Silver Sea Remnants}) at (H-8).
** After teleporting, use the east teleporter in the next room.
** In the next room, use the west teleporter.
** Once you arrive at (H-9), walk towards the exit to get the first cutscene.
** Turn around and take the west teleport in the same room.
** Walk south towards the exit to get the second cutscene (Avoid the {m:Apex Archaic Cogs}, which aggro true sight, true sound, __and__ magic.)

!Caedarva Mire-map1.jpg||Map 1
* After the above two cutscenes, it is time to progress to a battle. You'll need to have an {i:Imperial Silver Piece|Imperial Silver Piece|2185}, {k:Remnants Permit}, or {k:Captain Wildcat badge}, and follow the directions in the next step. You cannot access the area where the battle occurs via the rest of the ruins, only these specific entrances.
** Either use the Home Point to {z:Caedarva Mire}, or go to {z:Nashmau} and use the west exit to {z:Caedarva Mire}.
*** Once in {z:Caedarva Mire}, head to (E-11) and speak to {n:Nasheefa} to enter {z:Alzadaal Undersea Ruins}.

* Use the teleporter at (I-9) (the one to the right when entering the room), then examine the blank spot in the North-West corner of (G-7) for a cutscene.
** Examine the blank spot again to spawn a {m:Nepionic Soulflayer}.
*** If you have followed every step and the blank spot does not spawn the Soulflayer, logging out and back in may resolve the issue.
* Defeat the Soulflayer, then examine the blank spot again for another cutscene and your reward.
** If you zone after defeating the Soulflayer, but without triggering the final cutscene, you must fight it again.

